	| Name            | ${staticFixContent} |
	| Version         | 1.0                 |
	| Git Hash        | 991786d3dd          |
	| Status          | Complete            |
	| Type            | Workaround          |
	When I check the Patcher build for the ticket "${staticTicketNumber}" on the account "BROADCINTRAN" for merge completion
	And I check the Patcher build for the ticket "${staticTicketNumber}" on the account "BROADCINTRAN" for compile completion	
	Then I should be able to view a Patcher build for the ticket "${staticTicketNumber}" on the account "BROADCINTRAN" with the following values
	| Type            | Official                            |
